Package: ksjdata
Title: National Land Numerical Information of Japan
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mizuki", "Uchida", , "uchidamizuki@vivaldi.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides National Land Numerical Information (Kokudo
    Suuchi Joho) published by the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure,
    Transport and Tourism of Japan. A bundled catalog lists every
    downloadable file with its terms of use; the selected files are
    downloaded and read on demand by 'targets' pipelines bundled with
    the package, and cached via 'tarchives'. Attributes are named after
    the official attribute table and product specifications.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/UchidaMizuki/ksjdata
BugReports: https://github.com/UchidaMizuki/ksjdata/issues
